PROTAGONIST APPEARANCE — Lirael (APPEARANCE ESTABLISHED & LOCKED): the look is fixed canon, established earlier and locked separately for the image. Render CONSISTENTLY from the established appearance; do NOT restate a canonical descriptor list each scene. Surface a physical detail only when a beat genuinely earns it.
